{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:31 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:31 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:31 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d1c30f86d36e28dba89e488e9316534/2026-11/003_6.png\"/><p>今日（18日）下午5時許，一名20多歲男工人在北角港燈電燈中心的停車場電壓房工作，其間突然發生爆炸，工人走避不及燒傷雙手及面，全身嚴重熏黑，幸仍然清醒。同事隨即報警求助，消防到場亦出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，救護員到場將他送往瑪麗醫院治理，人員正調查意外原因。《星島頭條》正就事件向港燈查詢。</p><img alt=\"一名男工人在電壓房工作期間被炸傷。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17c2b22c99c7f6489d4e9d3539a9591a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_18_16_38_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8700ed1c1efb39e0e6d95dae4d6cac2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_18_15_51_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是港燈位於北角城市花園道28號的電燈中心。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7c0c13b7dffa13a0d2e4634b35460b9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_18_15_51_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多人需要疏散。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2652df2feeda10fab9daf3d9611fe637/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_18_15_50_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8c5202cf5e34e8b14ae9f99582cdf7c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_18_15_50_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:10.172526+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:31:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:57:23.368789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:21.009778+00:00","content_hash":"58a655262588385397f9b52d7701bc0b29a5fbc76da9c287ef7a1ae5860aa311","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}